#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:1
msgid "UART 接收 DMA、双向 DMA 与电气适配"
msgstr "UART receive DMA, duplex DMA and electrical adaptation"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:3
msgid ""
"UART 公共面继续使用 `nx_uart_port_t` 和共享只读 `nx_uart_ops_t`。实例由配置 "
"生成，调用方只保存接口和上下文。新机制按模式选择；既有 IRQ、`dma-tx`、 `irq-blocks` 的状态结构和默认 ops "
"槽数没有增加。生产代码仍为 C11，没有 heap、设备扫描、隐藏 worker 或默认 OS 锁。生产 owner 是 "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f4/`，当前精确芯片范围为 STM32F407VET6／ZGT6；不由家族目录 推导其他 F4 器件或全部 UART "
"模式已适配。Native 仅在 `tests/support/native/` 提供显式启用的主机测试支撑。"
msgstr ""
"The public UART face continues to use `nx_uart_port_t` and shared readonly "
"`nx_uart_ops_t`. Configuration generates instances; callers retain only the "
"interface and context. New mechanisms are selected by mode; existing IRQ, "
"`dma-tx` and `irq-blocks` state layouts and default ops slot counts do not "
"grow. Production code remains C11, without a heap, device scanning, hidden "
"workers or default OS locks. The production owner is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`, "
"with exact chip scope currently STM32F407VET6/ZGT6. A family directory does "
"not imply integration of other F4 devices or all UART modes. Native provides "
"explicitly enabled host-test support only under `tests/support/native/`."

