msgstr "`dma-duplex-continuous`"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:0
msgid "双向独立引擎，连续接收使用相同贷款协议"
msgstr ""
"Independent duplex engines; continuous receive uses the same loan protocol"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:20
msgid ""
"这里的接收／双向 DMA 模式只接入 STM32F407 USART1。RX 是 DMA2 stream2 channel4，TX 是 DMA2 "
"stream7 channel4。其他 UART 的 IRQ／有限 TX DMA 能力 "
"须按其独立配置合同选择，不能推导其已支持这里的接收模式。控制器编号来自芯片手册， 不能把公共 opaque resource ID 的编码当成物理 DMA"
" 编号。配置必须独占 UART、 DMA 目标、向量、时钟和引脚，冲突在生成阶段拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"The receive/duplex DMA modes here are integrated only for STM32F407 USART1. "
"RX uses DMA2 stream2 channel4, and TX uses DMA2 stream7 channel4. Other UART "
"IRQ/finite TX DMA capabilities must be selected under their independent "
"configuration contracts; they do not imply support for these receive modes. "
"Controller numbering comes from the chip manual. Public opaque resource ID "
"encodings must not be treated as physical DMA numbers. Configuration must "
"exclusively own the UART, DMA targets, vectors, clocks and pins; conflicts "
"reject during generation."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:26
msgid ""
"接收块容量为 1～65535 字节。连续模式至少有三个等容量块；有限模式允许 不同容量。DMA 目标必须落在已授权、可写且 DMA 可到达的区域；F407"
" 的 CCM 不属于接收 DMA 可达 SRAM。F407 没有 CPU D-cache，当前 provider 不执行 cache "
"clean/invalidate。其他芯片的接入必须重新核对内存域和缓存维护 合同，不能复用这里的无 cache 假设。"
msgstr ""
"Receive-block capacity is 1–65535 bytes. Continuous modes require at least "
"three equal-capacity blocks; finite modes permit different capacities. DMA "
"targets must reside in authorized, writable, DMA-reachable regions. F407 CCM "
"is outside SRAM reachable by receive DMA. F407 has no CPU D-cache, and the "
"current provider performs no cache clean/invalidate. Other chip integrations "
"must recheck memory domains and cache-maintenance contracts rather than reuse"
" this no-cache assumption."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:32
msgid ""
"STM32F407 的 RX-only 使用独立紧凑接收状态，保留普通 UART 前缀的 IRQ TX 能力；只有 duplex 在同一接收 owner "
"后附加 TX-DMA 扩展。两种模式复用接收 贷款算法，使用各自只读 ops 和直接 TX 调用，没有可选实现指针或运行时 `dma_transmit` "
"判断。RX-only 不取得或撤销 TX-DMA 目标，其链接不保留 TX-DMA ops；普通 IRQ 状态与默认 ops 槽数保持不变。这些是所选 "
"F407 实现的结构合同， 具体 RAM／Flash 成本仍以当前配置、工具链与 ARM ELF 为准，不是整个家族的常数。"
msgstr ""
"STM32F407 RX-only uses separate compact receive state while retaining IRQ TX "
"in the ordinary UART prefix. Only duplex appends the TX-DMA extension to the "
"same receive owner. Both modes reuse the receive-loan algorithm with separate"
" readonly ops and direct TX calls, without optional implementation pointers "
"or a runtime `dma_transmit` check. RX-only neither acquires nor withdraws TX-"
"DMA targets, and its link retains no TX-DMA ops. Ordinary IRQ state and "
"default ops slot counts remain unchanged. These are structural contracts of "
"the selected F407 implementation; actual RAM/Flash costs still depend on "
"current configuration, toolchain and ARM ELF, rather than being constants for"
" the whole family."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:39
msgid "块所有权与连续接收"
msgstr "Block ownership and continuous receive"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:41
msgid ""
"调用方初始化 `nx_stream_t` 与槽表，再通过 `nx_uart_port_rx_start` 借出。 设备负责 producer，调用方负责 "
"consumer。两者不能混用普通 producer 与 `nx_stream_post_*` 预置 producer "
"API。stream、槽表、所有块和 provider 状态 互不重叠，并在成功 `rx_stop` 和外部 observer 排空前保持有效。活动 TX"
" payload 不允许与整个 RX 块池重叠。"
msgstr ""
"Callers initialize `nx_stream_t` and slots, then lend them through "
"`nx_uart_port_rx_start`. Devices own producer responsibilities and callers "
"consumer responsibilities. Ordinary producer and `nx_stream_post_*` "
"preposted-producer APIs must not be mixed. Stream, slots, blocks and provider"
" state do not overlap and remain valid until successful `rx_stop` and "
"external-observer drain. Active TX payloads must not overlap the entire RX "
"block pool."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:47
msgid ""
"有限模式直接将 DMA 指向 caller payload，不做 CPU payload copy。TC、IDLE 或错误到达后，先撤销 UART DMA"
" request 和接收中断，再写 DMA disable。 实际 EN、request 与 interrupt 位回读证明静止后，才读取稳定剩余计数。 "
"最后再次读取 DMA/UART 错误，随后执行唯一 status/data 清除顺序。可靠的 正长度前缀才能 READY 发布；不可靠的前缀回退为 "
"FREE 并记录 loss。 stop 时没有收到的空块不会假发布为成功数据。"
msgstr ""
"Finite mode points DMA directly at caller payloads without CPU payload "
"copies. On TC, IDLE or error, it first withdraws UART DMA requests and "
"receive interrupts, then writes DMA disable. Actual EN, request and interrupt"
" readbacks establish quiescence before stable remaining counts are read. "
"Finally it rereads DMA/UART errors and performs the sole status/data clear "
"order. Only reliable positive-length prefixes become READY; unreliable "
"prefixes return FREE and record loss. Stop never falsely publishes an empty, "
"unreceived block as successful data."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:54
msgid ""
"连续模式以两个 FILLING 贷款启动双缓冲 DMA。TC 后先保留第三个 FREE 块， "
"再替换已完成的非活动目标。发布旧块前同时证明替换地址、另一个目标地址、 CT 位、EN、无新 TC/错误和旧地址从两个硬件目标中完全消失。失败不会将 "
"硬件仍可能写入的块交给 consumer；它撤源、排空并按 LIFO 撤销未来贷款。 成功发布遵守 FIFO。IRQ 不复制 "
"payload，只做有界控制和至多三个贷款处理。"
msgstr ""
"Continuous mode starts double-buffer DMA with two FILLING loans. After TC it "
"reserves a third FREE block before replacing the completed inactive target. "
"Before publishing the old block, it proves replacement address, other-target "
"address, CT, EN, absence of new TC/errors and removal of the old address from"
" both hardware targets. Failure never hands potentially writable memory to "
"consumers: it withdraws sources, drains and rolls back future loans in LIFO "
"order. Successful publication follows FIFO. IRQ copies no payload and "
"performs bounded control with at most three loans."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:60
msgid ""
"没有可替换 FREE 块时，立即停止接收写源并等待实际排空，保留 consumer 的 BORROWED "
"块。稳定的已完成块和部分块仍可发布，同时记录一次停止间隙。 不会猜测丢失字节数。失败的 disable 保留所有 producer 贷款，owner 后续"
" `service` 有界重试；这段时间调用方不能复用任何块或状态。"
msgstr ""
"Without a replacement FREE block, receive-write sources stop immediately and "
"await actual drain while retaining consumer BORROWED blocks. Stable completed"
" and partial blocks can still publish with one recorded stop gap, never a "
"guessed missing-byte count. Failed disable retains every producer loan; later"
" owner `service` retries boundedly. No block or state may be reused "
"meanwhile."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:65
msgid ""
"TC 是标志位，不是回绕计数器。连续资格要求最坏 IRQ 延迟和目标替换时间 小于一个块的填充时间；必须按实际波特率、块大小、中断优先级、屏蔽窗口和 并发"
" DMA 负载测量。软件检查能识别可观察的错误、目标变化与 CT 异常，不能 恢复任意多个合并的回绕。违反延迟预算时不能声称数据序列可靠，即使所有 "
"目标始终保持 FILLING 而没有侵犯 consumer 内存。"
msgstr ""
"TC is a flag, not a wrap counter. Continuous qualification requires worst-"
"case IRQ latency plus target-replacement time below one block-fill interval, "
"measured from actual baud, block size, interrupt priority, masked windows and"
" concurrent DMA load. Software detects observable errors, target changes and "
"CT anomalies but cannot recover arbitrarily many coalesced wraps. Violating "
"latency budgets prevents claims of reliable sequencing even if all targets "
"remain FILLING and consumer memory is untouched."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:71
msgid ""
"IDLE、有限块重启和容量压力后的恢复存在接收间隙。owner 的 service 周期 也是显式资源预算。重启前观察到 UART "
"overrun/error 会在清 status/data 前 记录 loss；无错误位的间隙不能凭软件推断精确遗漏数。loss 是已观测边界， 不是精确"
" wire 字节统计。上层协议决定是否允许间隙及如何恢复。"
msgstr ""
"IDLE, finite-block restart and capacity-pressure recovery create receive "
"gaps. Owner service periods are explicit resource budgets too. Observed UART "
"overrun/error before restart records loss before status/data clear; software "
"cannot infer exact omissions in gaps without error bits. Loss denotes "
"observed boundaries, not exact wire-byte statistics. Upper protocols decide "
"acceptable gaps and recovery."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:76
msgid "TX、停止与调用上下文"
msgstr "TX, stop and calling context"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:78
msgid ""
"TX DMA TC 只证明 payload 已送入外设，不证明最后一位已离开引脚。TX settlement 继续等待实际 UART "
"TC；取消仍先撤源，再证明 DMA/外设排空。 RX DMA 和 TX DMA 使用不同目标与向量，二者的完成状态互不替代。"
msgstr ""
"TX DMA TC proves only payload delivery to the peripheral, not the last bit "
"leaving the pin. TX settlement still waits for actual UART TC; cancellation "
"withdraws sources before proving DMA/peripheral drain. RX DMA and TX DMA use "
"separate targets and vectors; their completions never substitute for each "
"other."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:82
msgid ""
"`rx_start/rx_stop/service/stop` 由唯一未屏蔽的任务 executor 调用。ISR 只使用 生成器绑定的精确 IRQ "
"入口；保护区保存并恢复原中断状态。`rx_stop` 关闭 stream admission，可能返回 BUSY：已发布、已借用的块必须由 "
"consumer 正常 归还。成功必须同时满足源已撤销、引擎静止以及 outstanding 为零。关闭后 service 不重新启动 RX。完整 "
"`stop` 也先关闭 TX admission，只有 RX 排空 后才能停底层时钟。失败时不能销毁或更换 owner。"
msgstr ""
"`rx_start/rx_stop/service/stop` run on the sole unmasked task executor. ISRs "
"use only exact generated IRQ entries; protected spans save/restore incoming "
"interrupt state. `rx_stop` closes stream admission and may return BUSY: "
"published or borrowed blocks must be normally returned by consumers. Success "
"requires withdrawn sources, quiescent engines and zero outstanding loans. "
"Closed service never restarts RX. Complete `stop` first closes TX admission "
"too, and may stop underlying clocks only after RX drain. Failure prohibits "
"owner destruction or replacement."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:89
msgid "RTS/CTS 与 RS485"
msgstr "RTS/CTS and RS485"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:91
msgid ""
"`nx_stm32_uart_flow_configure` 是显式可选冷配置，设置 CR3 RTSE/CTSE， 读回失败会回滚。它在初始化后、活动 "
"TX/RX 开始前调用，不能修改正在运行的 借用。USART1 的可用信号为 PA11 CTS、PA12 RTS、AF7；这些芯片事实不代表当前 "
"四块开发板已经接线或外部设备支持握手，也不授权与 CAN／USB 复用引脚并选。 板级必须审核 PCB、GPIO 权限、电压、复用与 peer "
"行为再绑定。硬件 RTS 反映 UART 数据寄存器的接收状态，不代表软件块池剩余容量，不能替代协议 背压或在无 FREE 块时自动保证不丢数据。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_stm32_uart_flow_configure` is explicit optional cold configuration that "
"sets CR3 RTSE/CTSE and rolls back on failed readback. It runs after "
"initialization and before active TX/RX, and cannot alter live loans. USART1 "
"signals are PA11 CTS, PA12 RTS and AF7. These chip facts do not prove that "
"the four current boards are wired or that external devices support "
"handshaking, and do not authorize simultaneous selection with CAN/USB on "
"shared pins. Board integration must review PCB, GPIO authority, voltage, "
"multiplexing and peer behavior before binding. Hardware RTS reflects the UART"
" data register's receive state, not remaining software block-pool capacity. "
"It cannot replace protocol backpressure or automatically guarantee no loss "
"when no FREE block remains."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:99
msgid ""
"RS485 选用 `nx_uart_rs485_state_t`、不可变 `nx_uart_rs485_config_t` 和 "
"`nx_uart_rs485_ops`，默认 UART 状态不增加 DE、timer 或 task。调用方绑定 真实 GPIO、唯一授权位、DE "
"极性、setup/hold 时间以及精确底层 provider 的 纯 TX validator。validator 与 submit/start "
"共用同一拒绝规则；它不写 GPIO、 MMIO、不 admit，也不留引用。config、两个 face、ops、context 绑定和电气 "
"事实全程不可变，所有冷事实与 mutable request/payload/control 必须分离。 同一 executor 独占底层 TX；不得绕过"
" adapter 直接提交或修改 transport。"
msgstr ""
"RS485 selects `nx_uart_rs485_state_t`, immutable `nx_uart_rs485_config_t` and"
" `nx_uart_rs485_ops`; default UART state gains no DE, timer or task. Callers "
"bind real GPIO, a uniquely authorized bit, DE polarity, setup/hold time and "
"the exact provider's pure TX validator. Validator and submit/start share "
"rejection rules; validation writes no GPIO/MMIO, admits nothing and retains "
"no references. Config, both faces, ops/context bindings and electrical facts "
"remain immutable; all cold facts are separate from mutable "
"request/payload/control storage. The same executor exclusively owns "
"underlying TX; bypass submissions or transport changes are prohibited."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:107
msgid ""
"拒绝发生在 DE assertion 前。接受后 DE 建立成功才开始 setup，绝对 transfer deadline 包括 setup 与 "
"wire 完成。setup 超时不启动 UART。底层实际 SETTLED 才开始 hold，随后 DE 撤销成功，adapter 删除内部 "
"payload/active 引用，再 发布外层 SETTLED。失败的 drain 或 DE 撤销保留 QUARANTINED 外层贷款与 DE "
"所有权，owner service 重试。必需 drain/hold 可以延长借用超过 transfer deadline；不能因 deadline "
"已过就提前释放内存或 DE。"
msgstr ""
"Rejection precedes DE assertion. After acceptance, setup starts only after "
"successful DE assertion; the absolute transfer deadline includes setup and "
"wire completion. Setup timeout never starts UART. Hold starts only after "
"actual underlying SETTLED; successful DE withdrawal then removes internal "
"payload/active references before outer SETTLED publication. Failed drain or "
"DE withdrawal retains QUARANTINED outer loans and DE ownership for owner-"
"service retries. Required drain/hold may extend borrows beyond transfer "
"deadlines; expired deadlines never justify early memory or DE release."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:114
msgid ""
"setup/hold 使用 `nx_time_now_us` 的 monotonic 域；service 的最坏间隔决定 边界偏差。hold "
"保证至少声明时长，并不保证精确到时刻就撤 DE。精确波形 需求需要显式硬件 timer/电气预算，当前不会猜测收发器或提供假定时资格。"
msgstr ""
"Setup/hold uses the `nx_time_now_us` monotonic domain; worst-case service "
"gaps determine boundary error. Hold guarantees at least declared duration, "
"not exact-time DE withdrawal. Exact waveforms require explicit hardware-"
"timer/electrical budgets; this implementation invents neither transceiver "
"facts nor timing qualification."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:118
msgid "软件证据和实板验收"
msgstr "Software evidence and board acceptance"

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:120
msgid ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock 直接执行生产 provider，覆盖银行替换拒绝、CT 翻转、 地址错写、新错误到达 W1C "
"窗口、disable 拒绝、终止期间 DMA/UART 错误、 status/data 清除竞态、epoch 耗尽、双向取消、flow 配置、RS485 "
"setup/hold 和 DE 失败。Native adapter 另验证真实请求生命周期。这些结果建立软件 合同，不证明电气波形、总线仲裁或物理延迟。"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock directly execute production providers, covering "
"rejected bank replacement, CT flips, wrong address writes, new errors in W1C "
"windows, refused disable, terminal DMA/UART errors, status/data-clear races, "
"epoch exhaustion, duplex cancellation, flow configuration, RS485 setup/hold "
"and DE failures. Native adapters additionally verify real request lifecycles."
" Results establish software contracts, not electrical waveforms, bus "
"arbitration or physical latency."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:126
msgid ""
"当前 F4 接收、双向与 TX DMA 实现分别位于 "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/uart_receive.c`、`uart_duplex.c` 和 `uart_dma.c`， "
"冷态资源归还由同目录的 `uart_cold.c` 管理。公共 RS485 adapter 在 `io/src/` 实现，Native 叶模型位于 "
"`tests/support/native/drivers/`。模式与 factory 装配测试、 寄存器模型和 ARM 链接分别验证对应合同。"
msgstr ""
"Current F4 receive, duplex and TX DMA implementations reside in "
"`soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/uart_receive.c`, `uart_duplex.c` and `uart_dma.c`,"
" respectively. `uart_cold.c` in the same directory manages cold-state "
"resource release. The public RS485 adapter is implemented in `io/src/`, and "
"Native leaf models reside in `tests/support/native/drivers/`. Mode/factory "
"assembly tests, register models and ARM links verify their respective "
"contracts separately."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:132
msgid ""
"历史成对开发 ELF 只描述其记录的固定源码、配置和工具身份；跨系列计数、状态 大小或 text 差值不能继承为本轮 F4 "
"候选预算。当前候选必须重新绑定配置、源码、 ELF／map／nm 与工具身份，并验证 RX-only 不保留 TX-DMA 实现、duplex 保留所需 "
"独立引擎。结构复用不证明零 Flash 开销，也不证明实际 IRQ 周期。"
msgstr ""
"Historical paired development ELFs describe only their recorded fixed source,"
" configuration and tool identities. Cross-series counts, state sizes or text "
"deltas cannot become budget evidence for this F4 candidate. A current "
"candidate must bind configuration, source, ELF/map/nm and tool identities "
"afresh, verifying that RX-only retains no TX-DMA implementation while duplex "
"retains its required independent engines. Structural reuse proves neither "
"zero Flash overhead nor actual IRQ cycles."

#: docs/design/uart-dma-rs485.md:137
msgid ""
"当前没有连接实板，所有物理验收均未执行。实板退出条件包括：两个引擎 并行的最大 baud/负载，最坏 IRQ 与 service 延迟，目标换址和 "
"wrap 压力， consumer 长持有后的 overflow/recovery，IDLE 与最后 DMA beat 竞态，真实 TC wire "
"tail，RTS/CTS stall/resume，DE setup/hold 极性与边沿，以及反复 stop/start 后时钟、向量和 SRAM "
"贷款均排空。逐板记录 PCB 修订、探针、串口、 外部接线、逻辑分析仪原始波形和同一 ELF，未执行项不能标成通过。"
msgstr ""
"No physical boards are connected, and all physical acceptance remains "
"unexecuted. Board exit conditions include both engines' concurrent maximum "
"baud/load, worst IRQ/service latency, target-replacement/wrap pressure, "
"overflow/recovery after long consumer holds, IDLE/last-DMA-beat races, actual"
" TC wire tails, RTS/CTS stall/resume, DE setup/hold polarity/edges, and "
"drained clocks/vectors/SRAM loans after repeated stop/start. Record PCB "
"revision, probes, UARTs, external wiring, raw logic-analyzer waveforms and "
"the same ELF per board. Unexecuted items cannot pass."

msgid "无法表达 setup 预算时，在准入和 DE 效果前返回 EXHAUSTED；接纳后的失败仍须 实际撤回 DE。若底层传输已退出，却无法证明所声明的最低 hold，adapter 进入 TIMING_FAULT，保留 QUARANTINED、DE 与 outer loan；stop 返回 BUSY，不把 hold 清零或从过期 deadline 推定安全归还。此状态须由外部产品完成电气隔离与恢复， 普通重试不能虚构最低保持时间。"
msgstr "An unrepresentable setup budget returns EXHAUSTED before admission or DE effects. Failure after acceptance still requires actual DE withdrawal. If the underlying transfer has exited but the declared minimum hold cannot be proved, the adapter enters TIMING_FAULT and retains QUARANTINED, DE and the outer loan. Stop returns BUSY instead of zeroing hold or treating an expired deadline as permission to return storage. The external product must provide electrical isolation and recovery; ordinary retries cannot invent the minimum hold interval."

msgid "RX 与 duplex 共用不可变资源描述符，request、queue metadata 和每个完整 payload 不得覆盖配置或 DMA region 表。成功 stop 归还配置后，重复 stop 只检查已停止状态， 不再解引用归还的资源。在维护的 M4 ABI 下，RX 状态由 184 降至 176 B，duplex 由 200 降至 192 B；对应 ARM fixture SRAM 各少 8 B。该批还包含 CF03 与别名 guard， loaded Flash 分别增加 176／248 B，不能把状态缩减宣传为整固件零成本。"
msgstr "RX and duplex share immutable resource descriptors. Requests, queue metadata and full payload extents must not overlap configuration or DMA-region tables. After successful stop returns configuration ownership, repeated stop checks only stopped state and does not dereference returned resources. Under the maintained M4 ABI, RX state decreases from 184 to 176 B and duplex from 200 to 192 B; each corresponding ARM fixture uses 8 B less SRAM. This batch also includes CF03 and alias guards, with loaded Flash increasing by 176/248 B respectively. Smaller state is not a claim of zero whole-firmware cost."
